    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "And yet, this is not something I can leave up to faith. I was barely off-planet before putting the call in to Thornwing. The Ring of Thorns have been dispatched. No loose ends. It is how we've survived thus far, and how we will continue to survive."
    },
    {
